摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Windows DSH bundle: route the pwsh tool to PowerShell 7, with per-user detection/install and sandbox-aware execution.","id":"gh:1423287783","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-pwsh7","slug":"drliuhuan/dsh-plugin-pwsh7","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","powershell","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Windows DSH bundle: route the pwsh tool to PowerShell 7, with per-user detection/install and sandbox"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"e: route the pwsh tool to PowerShell 7, with per-user detection/install and sandbox-aware execution."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-pwsh7"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Windows DeepSeek Harness (DSH) bundle that routes the model-facing **`pwsh` tool to PowerShell 7**\n("},{"id":"p3s2","text":"`pwsh.exe`, major version >= 7) instead of falling back to Windows PowerShell 5.1."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- The executor inherits every behavior of the stock `dsh-pwsh-sandbox` executor: sandbox modes,\n`san"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"dbox_permissions` escalation, denial/runner-failure facts, background jobs, output caps, and\nexit ma"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rkers. It only replaces executable resolution.\n- When PowerShell 7 is missing, a model-facing **`she"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ll_router`** tool reports status, diagnoses\nsandbox problems, runs a self-check, switches routing, a"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"nd removes the plugin-managed copy.\n- **Installation is never automatic and is never started by the "},{"id":"p4s6","text":"model.** When PowerShell 7 is\nmissing, the Web GUI opens a setup dialog; installation only happens w"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"hen the user clicks the\ninstall action there or in **Settings → PowerShell 7**, or when the user ins"},{"id":"p4s8","text":"talls PowerShell 7\nmanually.\n- A **PowerShell 7 settings page** in the Web GUI shows the resolved ex"},{"id":"p4s9","text":"ecutable, version, install\ndirectory, scope and method, optionally **self-checks** the whole routing"},{"id":"p4s10","text":" stack, **switches\nrouting** back to the system default, **uninstalls** a plugin-managed per-user in"},{"id":"p4s11","text":"stall, and\n**migrates** a per-user install to the system scope.\n- In the Web GUI, a **setup dialog**"},{"id":"p4s12","text":" opens whenever PowerShell 7 is missing — on load and again on\nevery `pwsh` run — with a download bu"},{"id":"p4s13","text":"tton and live progress (bytes, percent, phase). Closing it\nnever cancels an install, and the next fa"},{"id":"p4s14","text":"iled run re-opens it."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"On Windows, DSH mounts `pwsh-sandbox` as `ctx.shell`, but the resolved executable can end up being\nW"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"indows PowerShell 5.1 in some environments. This bundle keeps the stock PowerShell executor and\nover"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"rides only its `pwshPath` resolution:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"1. **Take over the `pwsh-sandbox` slot**: a DSH patch entry's `name` asserts the targeted row, it\ndo"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"es not replace it, so the stock row is disabled by id and a `RouterPwshExecutor extends\nSandboxPwshE"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"xecutor` row (`id: pwsh7-executor`) is inserted. An explicit `config.pwshPath` still\nwins; otherwise"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" the plugin-resolved PowerShell 7 is used.\n2. **Insert the bare `dsh-plugin-pwsh7` row**, which regi"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"sters the `shell_router` tool\n(`status` / `diagnose` / `selfcheck` / `route` / `uninstall`), a small"},{"id":"p8s6","text":" system-prompt section, the\nsetup dialog/settings routes, and the browser bundle.\nThat row's name is"},{"id":"p8s7","text":" also what DSH's client-module scanner uses to discover `client.js`; the\nexecutor row's `./pwsh-exec"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"utor` subpath is not a client-bundle source."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Windows 10/11.\n- A DSH profile that supports bundles (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-base` / Web profile). Test"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ed against\nDSH desktop 0.2.1-rc.3.\n- Node.js >= 22 is only needed to run the repository test suite."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Upgrading an existing installation (whatever installed it)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The system-side upgrade does not assume MSI. It resolves the executable a **new terminal** gets\nfrom"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" the persisted machine+user `PATH`, classifies its installation, and uses the mechanism that\nowns it"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"the persisted machine+user `PATH`, classifies its installation, and uses the mechanism that\nowns it:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Original installation | Detection | Upgrade mechanism |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Machine-wide official MSI | uninstall registry product `PowerShell 7-x64` (HKLM) | `msiexec /i … A"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"LLUSERS=1` in place, one UAC prompt |\n| Per-user MSI | uninstall product in HKCU | `msiexec /i … ALL"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"USERS=0` in place (no elevation) |\n| Manual/portable ZIP on `PATH` | `pwsh.exe` in a directory with "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"no MSI/Store/package-manager marker | replace that directory: rename old → copy new → verify file ve"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"rsion → delete old; rollback on failure. The PATH entry is unchanged |\n| Chocolatey | `…\\chocolatey\\"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"bin\\pwsh.exe` shim | `choco upgrade powershell-core -y` (elevated when needed) |\n| Scoop | `…\\scoop\\"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"shims\\pwsh.exe` shim | `scoop update pwsh` (global: `-g`, elevated) |\n| Microsoft Store | `%LOCALAPP"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"DATA%\\Microsoft\\WindowsApps\\pwsh.exe` | `winget upgrade --id Microsoft.PowerShell --source msstore`;"},{"id":"p14s9","text":" if winget is absent, the error explains how to update from Store |\n| Plugin-managed per-user copy |"},{"id":"p14s10","text":" `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\dsh\\pwsh7\\powershell7\\<version>` | download the latest ZIP into a new version direc"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"tory and repoint the config |\n| Legacy plugin system side-by-side copy | `%ProgramFiles%\\PowerShell\\"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"7\\<version>` | upgrade the canonical MSI, then remove the versioned copy and its PATH entry |\n| `DSH"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"_PWSH_PATH` / row `pwshPath` override | explicit override wins | **refused** with an explanation; up"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"date that copy with its own installer or remove the override |\n| Unknown / missing | nothing detecte"},{"id":"p14s15","text":"d | install the official MSI into Program Files |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The same detection also supports `win-arm64` and `win-x86` releases, chosen from the OS\narchitecture"},{"id":"p15s2","text":". A missing package manager or a failed upgrade never silently falls back to installing\na separate p"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"er-user copy: the result names the concrete recovery command."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Path | Role |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `index.js` | Bare package row: installs `shell_router`, the system-prompt section, setup/settings "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"routes, and the reload hook |\n| `client.js` | Browser half: `shell.overlay` setup dialog plus the `s"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ettings.section` PowerShell 7 page, SSE + polling, install/route/uninstall/relocate/self-check actio"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ns, en/zh copy |\n| `lib/shipped.mjs` | Loads the shipped `@deepseek-ai/*` packages from the running "},{"id":"p18s5","text":"DSH installation (`app.asar`) |\n| `lib/paths.mjs` | PowerShell 7 detection, version probing, `config"},{"id":"p18s6","text":".json` IO |\n| `lib/route.mjs` | Routing mode (plugin/system/pwsh5) persistence, system-default and p"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"wsh5 executable resolution, install and legacy-copy description |\n| `lib/install-plan.mjs` | Detects"},{"id":"p18s8","text":" MSI/portable/Store/Chocolatey/Scoop/plugin installs from persisted PATH + registry and chooses the "},{"id":"p18s9","text":"upgrade strategy |\n| `lib/install.mjs` | User-scope portable install (official zip), system-scope MS"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"I/portable-in-place/package-manager upgrades, legacy copy cleanup, winget fallback; progress and pha"},{"id":"p18s11","text":"se callbacks |\n| `lib/install-scope.mjs` | Registry PATH persistence/removal (preserving value kind)"},{"id":"p18s12","text":", elevation probes, Program Files scope, system versioned-copy enumeration |\n| `lib/elevate.mjs` | O"},{"id":"p18s13","text":"ne-shot UAC helper: system MSI upgrade, canonical-version verification, legacy copy/PATH cleanup |\n|"},{"id":"p18s14","text":" `lib/state.mjs` | Process-wide resolution cache shared by the executor and the tool; missing-run si"},{"id":"p18s15","text":"` | Process-wide resolution cache shared by the executor and the tool; missing-run signal |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
